## Only use the ml_sim branch

https://github.com/Laurenhu2004/gem5_ycholab/tree/ml_sim

```bash
git checkout ml_sim
```

## Downloading Dependencies
Use the dependencies listed in environment.yml
```bash
conda env create -f environment.yml
conda activate gem5_clean
```

## Environment variables

Set these before building gem5

```bash
export CPATH="$CONDA_PREFIX/include"
export LIBRARY_PATH="$CONDA_PREFIX/lib"
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="$CONDA_PREFIX/lib"
export PKG_CONFIG_PATH="$CONDA_PREFIX/lib/pkgconfig"
```

## Building gem5

Use Scons
```bash
scons -j4 build/ARM/gem5.opt
```
Check: https://www.gem5.org/documentation/general_docs/building. The "Building with SCons" section explains the command.

## Matrix Multiplication gem5 Run Example

```bash
./build/ARM/gem5.opt configs/example/arm/starter_se.py --cpu=timing "<path to PerfVec>/Tutorials/mm 8 8 8"
```